      "text": "[3:42PM] #AlausaIkeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic along Obafemi Awolowo Way from the Shopping Mall through Coca-Cola Junction, Radio Bus Stop, Allen Junction, Olowu, and underneath the bridge is moving smoothly. Minor delays are observed only at intersection, due to  traffic alternations. The return journey follows similar conditions with overall fast movement.\n\nThe entire stretch of Lateef Jakande Road, from Coca-Cola/LTV 8 through Daily Times, Cadbury, First Gate, Wemco Junction, and up to Omole Roundabout, is experiencing good traffic flow. Slight delays are noted at intersection. The return journey is equally smooth.\n\nVehicular movement on Aromire Road heading inward to Adeniyi Jones is slightly busy but not problematic.\n\nMobolaji Johnson Avenue remains clear and free-flowing from Old Tollgate, 7UP Gate, and Billings Way up to the Alausa intersection.\n\nTraffic along Dr. Nurudeen Olowopopo Way, connecting to the Otedola Underbridge, is also moving at a fast pace.\n\nNo obstructions or impediments have been reported. Our men are present at important locations ensuring ease of movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
