      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1950944881955749934",
      "text": "[4:37PM] #OkeOdo #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere is smooth vehicular movement from Super/Katangua inward Ile Epo through Ogundare Junction down to Pleasure. The return journey from Pleasure heading back to Ile Epo, en route Super and Oja Oba, is also free-flowing.\n\nTraffic underneath the Jubilee Bridge moving toward the Charity Intersection remains steady. The stretch from Charity to Abattoir and onward to Charity Road, navigating Social Club and Olayiwola, is in good condition.\n\nBoth inbound and outbound movements on the Jubilee Bridge at Abule Egba are free of congestion.\n\nAlong Mobil to Awori, including the U-turn, Ahmadiyya, and down to Ijaiye, traffic is moving smoothly. However, movement towards Meiran is steady due to an earlier reported vehicle breakdown. The vehicle owner is present and working on repairs, while traffic officers are on ground managing the situation.\n\nThere is good traffic flow from Adura, Carso, Kola, Mosalashi, Abucon, and Alakuko down to Ajegunle via Amje. The return journey from Tollgate through Ajegunle, Kola, Meiran, Ijaiye, Ahmadiyya, and Awori back to Abule Egba also maintains a good pace.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
