    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1950946849075912718",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1950946849075912718",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1950946849075912718",
      "text": "[4:46PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere is slow vehicular movement when descending from CMS Bridge towards Offin Canal Market, primarily due to heavy traffic flow and ongoing market activities in the area. However, traffic eases up immediately after the Offin Canal Market stretch through to Ijora Olopa, by the NEPA intersection.\n\nTraffic remains steady along Broad Street through Apongbon underbridge, connecting Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo, largely influenced by closing-hour rush and market-related activities.\n\nMovement on Eko Bridge inward Apongbon and towards CMS remains smooth. Similarly, traffic descending from Idumota Bridge inward Ebute-Ero, Leventis, through UBA Roundabout connecting both inner and outer Marina, is currently free-flowing.\n\nAt present, there are no major impediments, and our men are actively on ground managing the situation effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
